# Docker build context for Dockerfile.onionos and Dockerfile.developer-ssh.
# Between them they COPY only the two paths whitelisted below, so send nothing
# else. Without this the whole repo (including multi-GB output/ build trees)
# was uploaded on every `docker build` / `make onionos`. The legacy builder
# only reads this root file, so it is deliberately not per-Dockerfile.
*
!vendor/miyoo/lib
!tools/miyoo/build-developer-ssh.sh
